The version mismatch is the direct cause:
| Router | RIP Config | Sends | Accepts |
|---|---|---|---|
| router2 | `version 1` | broadcast to 255.255.255.255 | v1 broadcasts only |
| router1 | `version 2` | multicast to 224.0.0.9 | v2 multicast only |
